<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  Radios on the USB port for which Android offers anynear (rescue via USB cable, ADR 0056).
  List as in Meshtastic-Android (androidApp/src/main/res/xml/device_filter.xml, GPL-3.0), plus Adafruit and Seeed
  entirely, because nRF52 radios (T1000-E: 0x239A/0x8029) use their IDs. Espressif entirely as well: an ESP32-S3 that is
  empty, in its ROM download mode (0x303A/0x0002) or runs factory software (own product IDs) is still an ESP32, and
  the app should be offered for it to install Meshtastic (ADR 0094). Same for the newer CH34x and Nordic's ID.
-->
